    "title": "Ohio pharmacist arrested overseas pleads guilty in IRS fraud case - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ashley Pomplas ,\n1 hours ago CLEVELAND, Ohio (WOIO) - An Ohio pharmacist who was indicted over a decade ago and was a fugitive on the run, has pleaded guilty in his role defrauding the IRS. According to the Department of Justice (DOJ), 57-year-old Sbeih Sbeih, previously of North Olmsted, was located and arrested earlier this year overseas in the country of Georgia. Read full article",
